# roadmap 6.F1: mixed_pair_probe.lua makes Chicago's first pair Atlanta's first player and
# Utah's, by changing the ROM table player_names, and plays the first quarter with it. The
# players' attribute tables (and with them heads, uniforms and ratings) and the announcer's
# name calls are the ones of the two named players, at tip-off and at the end of the quarter.
script tools/modtests/mixed_pair_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse
frames 14001
once mixed pair: places
once tipoff p1 want
once tipoff p2 want
once q1end p1 want
once q1end p2 want
once quarter over at
nolog error
nolog DIFFER
